thincoder.mcpServers.markdownDescription:
# MCP Servers
Model Context Protocol servers. Each key is a server name, value is a config object:

- `type`: "stdio" or "http" (auto-detected from command/url if omitted)
- `command` + `args`: for stdio transport
- `url` + `headers`: for HTTP transport

Example:
```json
{
  "thincoder.mcpServers": {
    "filesystem": { "command": "npx", "args": ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem", "/path"] },
    "my-api": { "url": "https://example.com/mcp", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer xxx" } }
  }
}
```
